---
// The big picture: GitHub, the daemon and its clients, and the runner containers Docker runs in the slice.
import Diagram from '../Diagram.astro';
---

<Diagram name="overview" caption="One daemon between GitHub and Docker; every client goes through its API.">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 480 486" role="img" aria-labelledby="overview-title" aria-describedby="overview-desc">
    <title id="overview-title">How runnerd fits together</title>
    <desc id="overview-desc">
      runnerd serve polls GitHub over HTTPS with the gh CLI's token and registers a just-in-time runner for each queued
      job it starts. Inside the daemon are the engine, the job history in SQLite, the API and the web dashboard.
      runnerctl and runnerctl tui reach the API over the Unix socket; a browser reaches the dashboard on 127.0.0.1:7477,
      which reads the same API. The daemon starts containers through the Docker API, in the slice whose MemoryMax is
      the budget: one per slot, here jvm 1, jvm 2, node 1 and node 2, plus the Docker Hub mirror.
    </desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="overview-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path class="head" d="M0 1L10 5L0 9z"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <rect class="box" x="0" y="0" width="300" height="60"></rect>
    <text class="t" x="16" y="26">GitHub</text>
    <text class="m" x="16" y="48">queued jobs, JIT runners, steps</text>

    <path class="line" d="M40 62V122" marker-start="url(#overview-arrow)" marker-end="url(#overview-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="m" x="56" y="88">HTTPS, the gh CLI's token:</text>
    <text class="m" x="56" y="108">polls, registers runners</text>

    <rect class="ink" x="0" y="126" width="300" height="168"></rect>
    <text class="t on-ink" x="16" y="154">runnerd serve</text>
    <text class="on-ink" x="16" y="186">engine: polls, plans, starts</text>
    <text class="on-ink" x="16" y="212">job history (SQLite)</text>
    <text class="on-ink" x="16" y="238">API: JSON and events</text>
    <text class="on-ink" x="16" y="264">dashboard</text>

    <rect class="box" x="330" y="126" width="150" height="52"></rect>
    <text x="344" y="148">runnerctl</text>
    <text class="m" x="344" y="168">Unix socket</text>
    <rect class="box" x="330" y="184" width="150" height="52"></rect>
    <text x="344" y="206">runnerctl tui</text>
    <text class="m" x="344" y="226">Unix socket</text>
    <rect class="box" x="330" y="242" width="150" height="52"></rect>
    <text x="344" y="264">browser</text>
    <text class="m" x="344" y="284">127.0.0.1:7477</text>
    <path class="line" d="M328 152H304" marker-end="url(#overview-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="line" d="M328 210H304" marker-end="url(#overview-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="line" d="M328 268H304" marker-end="url(#overview-arrow)"></path>

    <path class="line" d="M40 296V350" marker-end="url(#overview-arrow)"></path>
    <text class="m" x="56" y="328">Docker API</text>

    <rect class="frame" x="1" y="354" width="478" height="131"></rect>
    <text class="t" x="16" y="382">runnerd.slice</text>
    <text class="m" x="134" y="382">MemoryMax is the budget</text>
    <rect class="jvm" x="16" y="398" width="84" height="44"></rect>
    <text class="on-block" x="28" y="425">jvm 1</text>
    <rect class="jvm" x="106" y="398" width="84" height="44"></rect>
    <text class="on-block" x="118" y="425">jvm 2</text>
    <rect class="node" x="196" y="398" width="84" height="44"></rect>
    <text class="on-block" x="208" y="425">node 1</text>
    <rect class="node" x="286" y="398" width="84" height="44"></rect>
    <text class="on-block" x="298" y="425">node 2</text>
    <rect class="box-2" x="376" y="398" width="88" height="44"></rect>
    <text x="388" y="425">mirror</text>
    <text class="m" x="16" y="468">a slot's runner: one job, its own Docker, sysbox</text>
  </svg>
</Diagram>
